  "nativeAdaptations": [
    "Actual immutable native before/after records supply model and untransformed window boxes; no mounted transform reset, skew reset, CSS template or browser optimized-appear hook runs",
    "Actual native window/root identities own projection trees and same-window node-group membership. Matching React projection revisions/cohorts gate updates; unavailable/stale geometry fails instead of accepting caller rectangles",
    "Native transform arrays preserve pinned projection composition; an actual differential caught additive path rotation ordering. Numeric negative zero is normalized only when comparing native arrays with serialized CSS output",
    "The native value wrapper drives real numeric projection animation and scoped skip/reduced policies. Queued starts/frames retire with their actual native owner",
    "Source events use an explicit typed event map. Null native style resets release removed projection/pop fields. Actual platform visibility is separate from authored hidden/visibility state",
    "Native point/dp geometry is not WebKit-rounded. Browser SVG/WAAPI/style-variable paths are absent from the native View backend",
    "Scalar native radii cannot express general two-axis correction. An exact receiver is required and deliberately unavailable until implemented; a test recorder is not a native drawing acknowledgment",
    "Layout lifecycle public box signatures retain the pinned declarations; actual VisualElement/SubscriptionManager delivery keeps three argument slots and original/undefined boxes, including the source before-measure declaration/runtime discrepancy. Retired projection receivers cannot dispatch through a replacement node."
  ],
